      "definition": "(L) As used in this section, \"specified geographical notification area\" means the geographic area or areas within which the attorney general, by rule adopted under section 2950.13 of the Revised Code, requires the notice described in division (B) of this section to be given to the persons identified in divisions (A)(2) to (8) of this section.\n\nLast updated January 1, 2025 at 5:21 AM",
